.PP
Vite (French word for "fast", pronounced \fR/vit/\fP) is a new breed of frontend build tool that significantly improves the frontend development experience\&. It consists of two major parts:

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
A dev server that serves your source files over \fRnative ES modules\fP, with \fRrich built-in features\fP and astonishingly fast \fRHot Module Replacement (HMR)\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
A \fRbuild command\fP that bundles your code with \fRRollup\fP, pre-configured to output highly optimized static assets for production\&.
.PP

.PP
In addition, Vite is highly extensible via its \fRPlugin API\fP and \fRJavaScript API\fP with full typing support\&.

.PP
\fRRead the Docs to Learn More\fP\&. 
